#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUShelp.html:31
msgid "Playing the Game"
msgstr "游戏玩法"

#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUShelp.html:35
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<li> Check your connection to the live update server by looking at the "
"circle next to your name in the upper right. <br /> Orange = Connecting, "
"Green = Connected, Red = Disconncedted </li> <li>The active player has a "
"green background in the Players table</li> <li> In addition, after actions "
"have been chosen, the current move is highlighted in green in the action "
"selection area </li> <li>During the \"Choose Actions\" phase, any player "
"that has passed will have an orange background</li> <li> Place buildings, "
"lines, and passengers directly on the board. Vrrooomm by selecting "
"passengers and destinations on the board </li> <li>Choose your actions in "
"the upper right area or next to the board</li> <li> The Players table is in "
"order of the \"Choose Actions\" phase. So top player picks first <br /> If "
"no one chooses the \"Starting Player\" choice, then the player on the 2nd "
"line will become the new start player. </li> <li> To view another player's "
"actions, open the \"History\" tab and select a \"board\" action to highlight"
" that move </li> <li>Score is calculated as you play - Time Stone deductions"
" happen immediately, not at the end</li> <li>Any player can rewind at any "
"time. Please be courteous. Misuse will result in alteration of this "
"feature</li> <li> You can change which board you are playing on from the "
"menu. Select a preference in your <a class=\"linkOther\" "
"href=\"%(profile_url)s\">Profile</a> <br /> <b>NOTE: THE CHANGE IS COSMETIC "
"ONLY. BOTH BOARDS HAVE THE SAME CONNECTIONS <br /> THE ORIGINAL BOARD IS "
"ROTATED 90 DEGREES FROM THE 20TH ANNIVERSARY BOARD </b> </li>"
msgstr ""
"<li> 检查右上角名字旁的圆点，确认与实时更新服务器的连接。 <br /> 橙色 = 连接中，绿色 = 已连接，红色 = 已断开 </li> "
"<li>当前行动玩家在玩家表中为绿色背景</li> <li> 另外，选择行动后，当前走子会在行动选择区以绿色高亮 </li> "
"<li>在“选择行动”阶段，已过牌的玩家为橙色背景</li> <li> 将建筑、线路和乘客直接放在版图上。在版图上选择乘客与目的地即可 VRROOOMM"
" </li> <li>在右上区域或版图旁选择行动</li> <li> 玩家表按“选择行动”阶段顺序排列，因此最上方玩家先选 <br /> "
"若无人选择“起始玩家”，则第二行玩家成为新的起始玩家。 </li> <li> 要查看其他玩家的走子，打开“历史”标签并选择“board”动作以高亮该步 "
"</li> <li>分数随游戏进行即时计算——时间石扣分立即生效，而非结束时 </li> "
"<li>任何玩家可随时回退。请礼貌使用。滥用将导致此功能被修改</li> <li> 可在菜单中更换所用版图。在<a "
"class=\"linkOther\" href=\"%(profile_url)s\">个人资料</a>中选择偏好 <br /> "
"<b>注意：此更改仅为外观。两块版图连接相同 <br /> 原版图相对 20 周年版图旋转 90 度 </b> </li>"

#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUShelp.html:77
msgid "How can I find other players' moves?"
msgstr "如何查看其他玩家的走子？"

#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUShelp.html:80
msgid ""
"Click on History from the top menu to open the history, and then click on an"
" entry to highlight where it happened on the board. You can click entries to"
" see where buildings or lines were added, and to see where passengers were "
"VRROOOMM'd from and to."
msgstr ""
"点击顶部菜单的“历史”打开历史，然后点击条目以在版图上高亮发生的位置。你可以点击查看建筑或线路添加的位置，以及乘客 VRROOOMM 的起点与终点。"

#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUShelp.html:88
msgid "Why did I miss my turn?"
msgstr "为什么我的回合被跳过？"

#: .\BUS\templates\BUS\BUShelp.html:91
msgid ""
"Turns where you cannot do anything are skipped. For example, during VRROOOMM"
" if you either have no possible destination buildings, or no available "
"passengers to move. During Line Expansion, Add Passengers and New Buildings "
"then players are skipped if they would have 0 actions. In this case, it "
"means that the Max number of Buses is too low for these players to have any "
"actions. Check the history for the reason a player's turn was skipped."
msgstr ""
"无法做任何事的回合会被跳过。例如 VRROOOMM 中若没有可去建筑或没有可运乘客。线路扩展、添加乘客和新建筑阶段，若玩家行动数为 0 "
"也会被跳过。此时意味着巴士上限太低，这些玩家无法行动。请查看历史了解跳过原因。"

